            "block_content": "<p>As your reliable cleaning products and equipment supplier Clenli Direct will provide you with a hassle free service.</p><p>Along with your personally appointed service manager we will form a support team to cater for your unique requirements and ensure consistency of contact with a personalised service.</p><p>This is backed up with our bespoke service application (SAM) that creates a complete machine log for every site and machine.</p><p>As a result of our clever system, it does not matter which engineer last visited your site because our service team have complete access to your machines history at their fingertips.</p><p>This enables us to reach you even faster and gives you the peace of mind knowing that your equipment will be repaired or replaced immediately in the event of a breakdown.</p><p>Importantly, our internal systems are responsible for coordinating emergency call outs in a highly reliable and timely manner. This service is available 24 hours a day if required.</p><p>At present our service system (SAM) shows we are completing 99% of our jobs on site during the first call out.</p>",
